-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Feather_Fall\"> Condition: Feather Fall </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Rate of falling is slowed, granting <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Immunity</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders, found in containers, and carried by enemies</li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-666&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-356</span> on the table</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Baelen%27s_Pack\" title=\"Baelen's Pack\">Baelen's Pack</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>It is still possible to rescue him by throwing him the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Misty_Step\" title=\"Scroll of Misty Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Scroll_of_Misty_Step_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Misty_Step\" title=\"Scroll of Misty Step\">Scroll of Misty Step</a> from his backpack or another equivalent item and keep the rest of his backpack.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201641\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.085 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2754/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40268/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9299/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1200126/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.536      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   70.536      1 -total\n 39.64%   27.958     10 Template:Icon_text\n 36.37%   25.654     31 Template:Trim\n 16.58%   11.693      3 Template:Uid\n 10.72%    7.558      1 Template:Condition\n 10.21%    7.202      3 Template:Icon_link\n  9.66%    6.811      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.35%    6.595      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n  9.11%    6.426      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6345-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201641 and revision id 378945. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\